{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：07:24 2026-10-23 HKT<br/>發佈時間：07:24 2026-10-23 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：07:24 2026-10-23 HKT</p><img alt=\"體壇早報｜B費批評教練團不會被罰 般尼茅夫歐霸3戰全勝。路透社\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/db9f9e29341646da51b40fc0ebde0d5b/2026-10/index_15.jpg\"/><p>曼聯日前在歐聯大敗，B費賽後批評教練團的戰術部署，但據指他將不會被罰，至於卡域克則至少會在今個周末的英超繼續領軍。他們的對手般尼茅夫，今晨在歐霸主場以3：0擊敗有邁治蘭被逐的AC米蘭，歐霸3戰全勝。另外兩支英超代表則未能贏出，水晶宮作客以2：2賽和比朆達斯，新特蘭則以1：1與列治普斯納握手言和。</p><img alt=\"盧古美的致勝球被吹走。法新社\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8bb806a861430fe22bc21b96e875065a/2026-10/AFP__20261022__D46A7Q9__v2__HighRes__FblEurC3JuventusRennes.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T23:40:03.190178+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":231,"images":2,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T23:24:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T03:38:30.950629+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T23:38:11.264902+00:00","content_hash":"51472e4d2e324f60cdfcb7d5e5a88eb1230ec0e1695afaba7e0027c8aa58b0b0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}